     In mmddoocc documents, usage of semantic markup is recommended in order to
     have proper fonts automatically selected; only when no fitting semantic
     markup is available, consider falling back to _P_h_y_s_i_c_a_l _m_a_r_k_u_p macros.
     Whenever any mmddoocc macro switches the roff(7) font mode, it will automati‐
     cally restore the previous font when exiting its scope.  Manually switch‐
     ing the font using the roff(7) ‘\f’ font escape sequences is never re‐
     quired.

